# ---- 权重不进 git, 走 Release 附件 (见 models/README.md) ----
models/*.onnx
models/*.pt
models/*.part
# 拉权重: python -m tools.fetch_models

# ---- 爬虫产物: 只入库一份固定样本 v18.3b (识别层开箱即用), 其余不进 git ----
# 重新抓最新赛季: python -m scrape_info   (输出 workspace/scrape_info/v{版本}/)
# 抓单个阵容打法文档: python -m scrape_comp <阵容id>   (输出 workspace/scrape_comp/)
workspace/scrape_comp/
workspace/scrape_info/*
!workspace/scrape_info/v18.3b/
workspace/scrape_info/v18.3b/*
!workspace/scrape_info/v18.3b/chess_info/
!workspace/scrape_info/v18.3b/comps/
!workspace/scrape_info/v18.3b/images/
# 棋盘装备模板库是识别层缓存: equipment.ensure_board_template_library() 缺失时自动重建 (~10ms)
workspace/scrape_info/*/*.pkl
